{
  "_doc": "Allowlist of free channels whose live stream is published by the broadcaster itself (own domain or a CDN hostname carrying the broadcaster's name), without login, subscription or DRM. Each rule matches iptv-org entries by tvg-id AND url regex; anything else (restreams, raw IPs, pirate hosts) is rejected by construction. 'geo' documents a known territorial restriction; the app never tries to circumvent it. In addition, any stream served from the same registrable domain as the channel's official website (iptv-org database) is accepted automatically, but only shipped if the CI check reaches it.",
  "upstream": "https://github.com/iptv-org/iptv (streams/*.m3u) used only as an index of URLs; ownership is enforced by url_regex below.",
